cate/UUID/hello, no preauthentication effects, migration/downgrade refusals, fresh-key rotation, revocation of idle/live streams within one second, expiry and concurrent mutation-generation fencing. Exercise valid and invalid actual certificates, both role failures, stale/failed reads and recovery bypasses. Model fixtures alone never satisfy this product gate. |\\n./internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.6.0.md:15902:does not execute <code>AC-HOST-001</code>.\\n./internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.6.0.md:15914:| Mutual host authentication and credential lifecycle | Sections 1.5, 6.6, 11.10, 16, 17.1; AC-HOST-001 and SPEC-PUB-HOST-001 |\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1023,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 256,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
