ExitStatus reads exit_code from its raw bytes rather than through a\\n// json.Number field. encoding/json will unmarshal the JSON string \\\"9\\\" into a\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2738,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 685,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
